  "title": {
   "rendered": "Here We Shrink Again &#8211; Winter 2026 &#8211; Part 2"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "<p>We continue this week spotlighting some of the various products that were reduced in size toward the end of last year.</p>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Krusteaz Buttermilk Pancake Mix</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>Gene B. found a great example of a product &#8212; Krusteaz pancake mix &#8212; that was substantially downsized by over 20% without any reduction in price.  And the packages head-on look the same. Thanks also to David S.  who spotted the change.</p>\n<p><font  color=red>*MOUSE PRINT:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/krusteaz-32-25.jpg\" alt=\"Krusteaz pancake mix\" width=\"600\" height=\"465\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24018\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/krusteaz-32-25.jpg 600w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/krusteaz-32-25-300x233.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Hungry Jack Syrup</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>Well, if you get fewer pancakes out of your pancake mix, you also need less syrup. So the makers of Hungry Jack put the old fellow on a diet it seems by reducing their large bottles by 13% &#8212; from 27.6 ounces down to 24.</p>\n<p><font  color=red>*MOUSE PRINT:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/hungryjack-27-24b-mp.jpg\" alt=\"Hungry Jack syrup\" width=\"700\" height=\"455\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24086\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/hungryjack-27-24b-mp.jpg 700w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/hungryjack-27-24b-mp-300x195.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Post Premier Protein Cereal</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>The attack on breakfast products continues with several varieties of Post protein cereals recently shrinking.  The 11-ounce boxes became just 9 ounces, but to look at them side-by-side, they look the same size. Thanks to Jeff W. for sending the picture of the chocolate variety.</p>\n<p><font  color=red>*MOUSE PRINT:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/post-premier-choc-11-9.jpg\" alt=\"Post Premier Chocolate cereal\" width=\"500\" height=\"418\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24020\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/post-premier-choc-11-9.jpg 500w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/post-premier-choc-11-9-300x251.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/post-premier-11-9mp.jpg\" alt=\"Post Premier cereal\n\" width=\"760\" height=\"610\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24021\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/post-premier-11-9mp.jpg 760w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/post-premier-11-9mp-300x241.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Flamingo Estate Shampoo</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>Gabriel C. found that a favorite and very expensive shampoo ($50 bottle) had downsized from almost 17 ounces to only 12 ounces.  And almost unbelievably, the price stayed the same. Were they really not making enough profit that they had to shrink the $50 bottle???</p>\n<p><font  color=red>*MOUSE PRINT:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/flamingo-estate-mp.jpg\" alt=\"Flamingo Estate shampoo\" width=\"310\" height=\"500\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24019\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/flamingo-estate-mp.jpg 310w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/flamingo-estate-mp-186x300.jpg 186w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 310px) 100vw, 310px\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Hershey&#8217;s Snack Size Chocolate</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>Grant in Iowa discovered that Hershey&#8217;s snack size chocolate lost almost two ounces per bag, going from 19.8 ounces down to 18 ounces.</p>\n<p><font  color=red>*MOUSE PRINT:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/hershey-snack-19-18mp.jpg\" alt=\"Hershey&#039;s snack size\" width=\"700\" height=\"275\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24023\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/hershey-snack-19-18mp.jpg 700w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/hershey-snack-19-18mp-300x118.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></p>\n<hr width=200>\n<p>If you find a product that has recently been downsized, please take a picture of the old and new version side-by-side if possible and send it to: Edgar(at symbol)MousePrint.org . Thanks.</p>\n",
   "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
   "rendered": "<p>We continue this week spotlighting some of the various products that were reduced in size toward the end of last year. Krusteaz Buttermilk Pancake Mix Gene B. found a great example of a product &#8212; Krusteaz pancake mix &#8212; that was substantially downsized by over 20% without any reduction in price. And the packages head-on &#8230; <a title=\"Here We Shrink Again &#8211; Winter 2026 &#8211; Part 2\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/2026/01/26/here-we-shrink-again-winter-2026-part-2/\" aria-label=\"Read more about Here We Shrink Again &#8211; Winter 2026 &#8211; Part 2\">Read more</a></p>\n",
